6O50hqkyNqA	https://unsplash.com/photos/6O50hqkyNqA	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1543676811-c5de032316fa	2018-12-01 15:07:07.096584	t	4586	3052	1.5	On this morning my main target was Green Herons but when this lovely Great Blue waded right by searching for food in the gorgeous morning light with a nice reflection I wasn’t about to pass it up.  They are still a great bird when you spend time with them.  I was hoping to capture it with a big catch since I’ve seen them pull some really large pickeral out of this pond but I was still happy with the portrait.  At one point this bird worked its way pretty close to me and since I was set up so low in the water I was actually looking up at it, which is always an interesting perspective.	rayhennessy	Ray	Hennessy	NIKON CORPORATION	NIKON D4S	400	4.0	500.0	1/2500	Whitesbog Trails, Browns Mills, NJ 08015, USA, Manchester Township, United States	39.965135	-74.48550167	United States	Manchester Township	449003	3496	white crane					L98|*7xb9aEM:|oIS6NbSjWAsls:
