12C54hCyvUM	https://unsplash.com/photos/12C54hCyvUM	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1565049048182-522f760a94dc	2019-08-05 23:51:56.147516	t	6016	4016	1.5	"""Immiscible 4"". Oil on water. Droplets of olive oil floating on water. Lighting is from the side and underneath, bouncing off an abstract painting I call ""Mediterranean Gold"". In this painting I used coarse brushes to scumble purple, blue, gold, white and scarlet over each other. The colour combination is inspired from colours often seen around the Mediterranean coast, and from the colours of the garments of the Old Testament priesthood. Olive oil seems appropriate. I used a 90mm macro lens, and for some of these photos, an extension tube as well. Please see the tutorial on the page ""Oil and water photography"" on my site Tracts4Free.WordPress.com."	davidclode	David	Clode	NIKON CORPORATION	NIKON D750	200	6.7	90.0	1/250	Cairns, Australia			Australia	Cairns	2231488	6082	red, yellow, and blue dots					LUH9]~}[oxtQ9[Sds,WAJ8NLnnxY
