tsStT0oQhY8	https://unsplash.com/photos/tsStT0oQhY8	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1548262783-202c5b633d80	2019-01-23 17:00:36.702587	t	5184	3456	1.5	I was driving the snowwy landscape to office, until I couldn't resist a little detour through the forest. I had to get out for a couple of minutes and pulled over at a parking lot for visitors to the space observatory. It was so quiet. Suddenly an isolated wind went through the trees along the entry road to the place. I turned around and in an impulse snapped a shot with the phone I was holding, capturing the curtain of flakes leaving their thin branches. The shot doesn't quite reflect how peaceful this scene actually was; but it gets me back in there and that will do.	stijnverplancke	Stijn	Verplancke	Canon	Canon EOS 4000D	100	4.5	29.0	1/60	Domein Beisbroek, België	51.165935	3.149192	België		515838	6037	trees covered with snow					LiC*U*xvROay8_bIodjZ?woeWXae
