vbRAHOuc05w	https://unsplash.com/photos/vbRAHOuc05w	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1508558987414-f9a951573609	2017-10-21 04:12:12.22915	t	4229	2819	1.5	During a  storm there is lightning , After a storm there is a rainbow – In pursuit of rainbow & lightning.        Powerful, fast moving and impulsive late-summer storms in Grand Canyon provide some of the most remarkable light. Tried Chasing these clouds hoping to get lightning/rainbow,  Anticipating for the decisive moment to happen, but nature have different plans for you.   Wind changed  in few seconds & I was completely drenched.	madhu_shesharam	Madhu	Shesharam	FUJIFILM	X-T10	200	11.0	18.0	1/80	Grand Canyon Village, United States	36.0544445	-112.1401108	United States	Grand Canyon Village	869856	15835	Thunderstorm					LE8}c3?wxua#DhV?o#j[4TDiMxoc
